04ebd84d133d25bec6f3763237.jpg%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2Fb%2F2%2Fa%2Fb2ab6804ebd84d133d25bec6f3763237.jpg%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2Fb%2F2%2Fa%2Fb2ab6804ebd84d133d25bec6f3763237.jpg%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="sc-4a7d729f-7 ikJonP">Game of the Week</div></div><div class="sc-4a7d729f-2 lcNRbt"><a href="https://en.aptoide.com/editorial/knock-knock-room-defense" class="sc-4a7d729f-4 fdqrnU">Knock Knock: Room Defense</a><div class="sc-4a7d729f-8 hXeUkR"><span type="description" class="sc-4a7d729f-3 iXPmSu">Something is at the door, and every second matters. Knock Knock: Room Defense turns a simple room into a tense survival puzzle for Android players.

Knock Knock: Room Defense is a mobile defense game about surviving attacks by strengthening your room and making smart upgrades. It suits players who enjoy quick strategy, escalating pressure, and clear progression.</span></div></div></div><div page="editorial-home" class="sc-4a7d729f-1 irhQms"><div class="sc-4a7d729f-0 jHqsbK"><div class="sc-4a7d729f-9"><img alt="sea-of-doom - editorial" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-fit:cover;color:transparent" sizes="100vw" srcSet="https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2Fc%2F4%2Fd%2Fc4d5f332396109d4f1a7f24e37b215e1.jpg%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2Fc%2F4%2Fd%2Fc4d5f332396109d4f1a7f24e37b215e1.jpg%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2Fc%2F4%2Fd%2Fc4d5f332396109d4f1a7f24e37b215e1.jpg%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2Fc%2F4%2Fd%2Fc4d5f332396109d4f1a7f24e37b215e1.jpg%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2Fc%2F4%2Fd%2Fc4d5f332396109d4f1a7f24e37b215e1.jpg%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2Fc%2F4%2Fd%2Fc4d5f332396109d4f1a7f24e37b215e1.jpg%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2Fc%2F4%2Fd%2Fc4d5f332396109d4f1a7f24e37b215e1.jpg%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2Fc%2F4%2Fd%2Fc4d5f332396109d4f1a7f24e37b215e1.jpg%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2Fc%2F4%2Fd%2Fc4d5f332396109d4f1a7f24e37b215e1.jpg%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="sc-4a7d729f-7 ikJonP">Events</div></div><div class="sc-4a7d729f-2 lcNRbt"><a href="https://en.aptoide.com/editorial/sea-of-doom" class="sc-4a7d729f-4 fdqrnU">Sea of Doom</a><div class="sc-4a7d729f-8 hXeUkR"><span type="description" class="sc-4a7d729f-3 iXPmSu">Brave the Sea of Doom in Duck Survival!
The Sea of Doom event has arrived in Duck Survival, bringing a limited-time nautical adventure filled with waves of enemies, powerful bosses, and special rewards. The event runs from August 11, 2026, to August 17, 2026.
Take on the event challenges and work toward rewards including the Vortex Frenzy Shark mount, Poseidon’s Trident, and legendary artifacts such as the Abyssal Tentacle, Dead Tide Vortex, Storm Anchor, and Gold Ram.
With only one week to participate, make the most of your daily event activities and progress through the available milestones to collect rewards along the way.
Prepare your squad, face the dangers of the Sea of Doom, and claim your rewards before the event ends on August 17, 2026.</span></div></div></div><div page="editorial-home" class="sc-4a7d729f-1 irhQms"><div class="sc-4a7d729f-0 jHqsbK"><div class="sc-4a7d729f-9"><img alt="ludus-new-character-chainsaw - editorial" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-fit:cover;color:transparent" sizes="100vw" srcSet="https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2F2%2F5%2Fe%2F25eb3362fd6346f2ca54971083eb9772.png%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2F2%2F5%2Fe%2F25eb3362fd6346f2ca54971083eb9772.png%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2F2%2F5%2Fe%2F25eb3362fd6346f2ca54971083eb9772.png%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2F2%2F5%2Fe%2F25eb3362fd6346f2ca54971083eb9772.png%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2F2%2F5%2Fe%2F25eb3362fd6346f2ca54971083eb9772.png%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2F2%2F5%2Fe%2F25eb3362fd6346f2ca54971083eb9772.png%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2F2%2F5%2Fe%2F25eb3362fd6346f2ca54971083eb9772.png%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2F2%2F5%2Fe%2F25eb3362fd6346f2ca54971083eb9772.png%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2F2%2F5%2Fe%2F25eb3362fd6346f2ca54971083eb9772.png%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="sc-4a7d729f-7 ikJonP">Events</div></div><div class="sc-4a7d729f-2 lcNRbt"><a href="https://en.aptoide.com/editorial/ludus-new-character-chainsaw" class="sc-4a7d729f-4 fdqrnU">Ludus: New character – Chainsaw!</a><div class="sc-4a7d729f-8 hXeUkR"><span type="description" class="sc-4a7d729f-3 iXPmSu">Meet Chainsaw, the New Fighter in LUDUS!
A powerful new character is joining LUDUS・Strategy Battle PvP Game. Meet Chainsaw, a fierce fighter equipped with deadly saw-blade gauntlets designed to bring enemies straight into danger.
Chainsaw can drag opponents toward him before unleashing his devastating blades, making him a dangerous new addition to the battlefield.
Add Chainsaw to your lineup, discover his combat abilities, and find new strategies to dominate your opponents in LUDUS!</span></div></div></div><div page="editorial-home" class="sc-4a7d729f-1 irhQms"><div class="sc-4a7d729f-0 jHqsbK"><div class="sc-4a7d729f-9"><img alt="harvest-festival - editorial" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-fit:cover;color:transparent" sizes="100vw" srcSet="https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2F5%2F2%2Fe%2F52e3976d956356d71c26b79a04845008.png%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2F5%2F2%2Fe%2F52e3976d956356d71c26b79a04845008.png%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2F5%2F2%2Fe%2F52e3976d956356d71c26b79a04845008.png%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2F5%2F2%2Fe%2F52e3976d956356d71c26b79a04845008.png%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2F5%2F2%2Fe%2F52e3976d956356d71c26b79a04845008.png%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2F5%2F2%2Fe%2F52e3976d956356d71c26b79a04845008.png%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2F5%2F2%2Fe%2F52e3976d956356d71c26b79a04845008.png%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2F5%2F2%2Fe%2F52e3976d956356d71c26b79a04845008.png%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2F5%2F2%2Fe%2F52e3976d956356d71c26b79a04845008.png%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="sc-4a7d729f-7 ikJonP">Events</div></div><div class="sc-4a7d729f-2 lcNRbt"><a href="https://en.aptoide.com/editorial/harvest-festival" class="sc-4a7d729f-4 fdqrnU">Harvest Festival</a><div class="sc-4a7d729f-8 hXeUkR"><span type="description" class="sc-4a7d729f-3 iXPmSu">Celebrate the Harvest Festival in Infinity Kingdom!
The Harvest Festival has arrived in Infinity Kingdom, bringing seasonal activities, exclusive collectibles, and special autumn rewards. From August 10, 2026, to August 19, 2026, players on servers that have been running for more than 14 days can join the celebration.
Take part in activities including Lucky Koi, Harvest Festival Pass, Harvest Catch, Harvest Pastime, Glory Challenge, Pinnacle Trial, Dazzling Wish, and the Exchange Shop to collect limited items and valuable in-game rewards.
The festival also introduces new Immortal skins, giving players more ways to customize their lineup and explore different combat possibilities while strengthening their team.
Join the Harvest Festival, complete the seasonal activities, and collect your limited-time rewards before the event ends on August 19, 2026.</span></div></div></div><div page="editorial-home" class="sc-4a7d729f-1 irhQms"><div class="sc-4a7d729f-0 jHqsbK"><div class="sc-4a7d729f-9"><img alt="new-character-eris-goddess-of-discord - editorial" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-fit:cover;color:transparent" sizes="100vw" srcSet="https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2F5%2F7%2F4%2F57453b3d4663bdd8bf5996d3876515a6.jpg%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2F5%2F7%2F4%2F57453b3d4663bdd8bf5996d3876515a6.jpg%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2F5%2F7%2F4%2F57453b3d4663bdd8bf5996d3876515a6.jpg%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2F5%2F7%2F4%2F57453b3d4663bdd8bf5996d3876515a6.jpg%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2F5%2F7%2F4%2F57453b3d4663bdd8bf5996d3876515a6.jpg%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2F5%2F7%2F4%2F57453b3d4663bdd8bf5996d3876515a6.jpg%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2F5%2F7%2F4%2F57453b3d4663bdd8bf5996d3876515a6.jpg%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2F5%2F7%2F4%2F57453b3d4663bdd8bf5996d3876515a6.jpg%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2F5%2F7%2F4%2F57453b3d4663bdd8bf5996d3876515a6.jpg%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="sc-4a7d729f-7 ikJonP">Events</div></div><div class="sc-4a7d729f-2 lcNRbt"><a href="https://en.aptoide.com/editorial/new-character-eris-goddess-of-discord" class="sc-4a7d729f-4 fdqrnU">New Character Eris — Goddess of Discord</a><div class="sc-4a7d729f-8 hXeUkR"><span type="description" class="sc-4a7d729f-3 iXPmSu">Unleash Chaos with Eris, the Goddess of Discord!
A powerful new character has arrived! Eris — Goddess of Discord enters the battlefield alongside her deadly puppet, bringing colossal single-target damage and a taste for chaos.
Eris thrives wherever conflict takes root, breaking even the strongest bonds through cunning and manipulation. In battle, she and her puppet can unleash devastating attacks against individual enemies, making Eris a powerful addition to your team.
To celebrate her arrival, players can also grab event bundles with discounts of up to 40%, offering valuable resources at special prices.
Summon Eris, the Goddess of Discord, strengthen your lineup, and take advantage of the limited-time event offers while they’re available!

START DATE: 2026-08-11
END DATE: 2026-08-25</span></div></div></div><div page="editorial-home" class="sc-4a7d729f-1 irhQms"><div class="sc-4a7d729f-0 jHqsbK"><div class="sc-4a7d729f-9"><img alt="atlantis-ludus-event - editorial" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-fit:cover;color:transparent" sizes="100vw" srcSet="https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2F5%2Fe%2F8%2F5e8170663b749b0e65aa2140d635e0d8.jpg%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2F5%2Fe%2F8%2F5e8170663b749b0e65aa2140d635e0d8.jpg%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2F5%2Fe%2F8%2F5e8170663b749b0e65aa2140d635e0d8.jpg%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2F5%2Fe%2F8%2F5e8170663b749b0e65aa2140d635e0d8.jpg%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2F5%2Fe%2F8%2F5e8170663b749b0e65aa2140d635e0d8.jpg%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2F5%2Fe%2F8%2F5e8170663b749b0e65aa2140d635e0d8.jpg%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2F5%2Fe%2F8%2F5e8170663b749b0e65aa2140d635e0d8.jpg%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2F5%2Fe%2F8%2F5e8170663b749b0e65aa2140d635e0d8.jpg%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2F5%2Fe%2F8%2F5e8170663b749b0e65aa2140d635e0d8.jpg%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="sc-4a7d729f-7 ikJonP">Special Event</div></div><div class="sc-4a7d729f-2 lcNRbt"><a href="https://en.aptoide.com/editorial/atlantis-ludus-event" class="sc-4a7d729f-4 fdqrnU">Atlantis – Ludus Event</a><div class="sc-4a7d729f-8 hXeUkR"><span type="description" class="sc-4a7d729f-3 iXPmSu">Discover Rare Rewards in the Atlantis Event!
The Atlantis event has arrived in LUDUS・Strategy Battle PvP Game, inviting players to explore a mysterious underwater world filled with exclusive rewards. Running from August 6, 2026, to August 10, 2026, this limited-time event offers a new challenge for strategy and card battle fans.
Venture into Atlantis to open shells, collect masks, and dive deeper in search of rare loot and the coveted Universal Star Perk. Strengthen your heroes, enhance your deck, and prepare for even greater challenges as you progress through the event.
Whether you enjoy tactical PvP battles, arena competitions, or building the ultimate squad, Atlantis is the perfect opportunity to earn valuable rewards and boost your team’s power.
Enter Atlantis, complete the event challenges, and claim your exclusive rewards before the event ends on August 10, 2026.</span></div></div></div><div page="editorial-home" class="sc-4a7d729f-1 irhQms"><div class="sc-4a7d729f-0 jHqsbK"><div class="sc-4a7d729f-9"><img alt="vikings-birthday - editorial" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-fit:cover;color:transparent" sizes="100vw" srcSet="https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2F4%2Ff%2Ff%2F4ff09d69076c7226fc46a6e1f70fae01.jpg%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2F4%2Ff%2Ff%2F4ff09d69076c7226fc46a6e1f70fae01.jpg%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2F4%2Ff%2Ff%2F4ff09d69076c7226fc46a6e1f70fae01.jpg%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2F4%2Ff%2Ff%2F4ff09d69076c7226fc46a6e1f70fae01.jpg%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2F4%2Ff%2Ff%2F4ff09d69076c7226fc46a6e1f70fae01.jpg%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2F4%2Ff%2Ff%2F4ff09d69076c7226fc46a6e1f70fae01.jpg%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2F4%2Ff%2Ff%2F4ff09d69076c7226fc46a6e1f70fae01.jpg%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2F4%2Ff%2Ff%2F4ff09d69076c7226fc46a6e1f70fae01.jpg%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2F4%2Ff%2Ff%2F4ff09d69076c7226fc46a6e1f70fae01.jpg%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="sc-4a7d729f-7 ikJonP">Special Event</div></div><div class="sc-4a7d729f-2 lcNRbt"><a href="https://en.aptoide.com/editorial/vikings-birthday" class="sc-4a7d729f-4 fdqrnU">Vikings’ Birthday</a><div class="sc-4a7d729f-8 hXeUkR"><span type="description" class="sc-4a7d729f-3 iXPmSu">Join the Vikings’ Birthday Celebration!
The Vikings’ Birthday event has arrived in Vikings: War of Clans, bringing a month-long celebration filled with bonuses, surprises, and special activities. From August 1, 2026, to September 1, 2026, players can take part in the festivities and enjoy exclusive event rewards.
The celebration features a variety of bonuses and surprises throughout the event period, giving both new and veteran Jarls plenty of reasons to join the feast. Be sure to keep an eye on the event schedule so you don’t miss any special activities or rewards.
Whether you’re strengthening your kingdom or returning to the battlefield, now is the perfect time to celebrate another year of Viking adventures.
Log in, join the birthday festivities, and claim your rewards before the celebration ends on September 1, 2026.</span></div></div></div><div page="editorial-home" class="sc-4a7d729f-1 irhQms"><div class="sc-4a7d729f-0 jHqsbK"><div class="sc-4a7d729f-9"><img alt="enter-the-unknown-lom - editorial" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-fit:cover;color:transparent" sizes="100vw" srcSet="https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2F8%2F0%2F9%2F809ec2ee470ddcd98b7cd55e9fa122b2.png%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2F8%2F0%2F9%2F809ec2ee470ddcd98b7cd55e9fa122b2.png%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2F8%2F0%2F9%2F809ec2ee470ddcd98b7cd55e9fa122b2.png%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2F8%2F0%2F9%2F809ec2ee470ddcd98b7cd55e9fa122b2.png%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2F8%2F0%2F9%2F809ec2ee470ddcd98b7cd55e9fa122b2.png%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2F8%2F0%2F9%2F809ec2ee470ddcd98b7cd55e9fa122b2.png%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2F8%2F0%2F9%2F809ec2ee470ddcd98b7cd55e9fa122b2.png%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2F8%2F0%2F9%2F809ec2ee470ddcd98b7cd55e9fa122b2.png%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="https://static-images.aptoide.com/_nex