A brand-new adventure awaits in the Aug. 1st Event! From August 7, 2026, to August 13, 2026, players are invited to Enter the Unknown and take on exciting new challenges for a chance to earn valuable rewards.
Explore mysterious encounters, complete event objectives, and discover surprises hidden throughout this limited-time event. Every challenge you overcome brings you closer to exclusive rewards and new opportunities to strengthen your journey.
Don’t miss your chance to venture into the unknown. Log in, join the event, and claim your rewards before the Aug. 1st Event comes to an end.</span></div></div></div><div page="editorial-home" class="sc-4a7d729f-1 irhQms"><div class="sc-4a7d729f-0 jHqsbK"><div class="sc-4a7d729f-9"><img alt="claim-your-legendary-dream-chest - editorial" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-fit:cover;color:transparent" sizes="100vw" srcSet="https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2F4%2F0%2F0%2F40007141682e78e4a13c6267f6a3f218.jpg%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2F4%2F0%2F0%2F40007141682e78e4a13c6267f6a3f218.jpg%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2F4%2F0%2F0%2F40007141682e78e4a13c6267f6a3f218.jpg%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2F4%2F0%2F0%2F40007141682e78e4a13c6267f6a3f218.jpg%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2F4%2F0%2F0%2F40007141682e78e4a13c6267f6a3f218.jpg%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2F4%2F0%2F0%2F40007141682e78e4a13c6267f6a3f218.jpg%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2F4%2F0%2F0%2F40007141682e78e4a13c6267f6a3f218.jpg%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2F4%2F0%2F0%2F40007141682e78e4a13c6267f6a3f218.jpg%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2F4%2F0%2F0%2F40007141682e78e4a13c6267f6a3f218.jpg%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="sc-4a7d729f-7 ikJonP">Events</div></div><div class="sc-4a7d729f-2 lcNRbt"><a href="https://en.aptoide.com/editorial/claim-your-legendary-dream-chest" class="sc-4a7d729f-4 fdqrnU">Claim Your Legendary Dream Chest!</a><div class="sc-4a7d729f-8 hXeUkR"><span type="description" class="sc-4a7d729f-3 iXPmSu">The Claim Your Legendary Dream Chest! event is now live, inviting players to dive back into the mysterious Dream Crisis and uncover hidden treasures. From July 23, 2026, to July 31, 2026, you’ll have the chance to earn valuable rewards through this limited-time event.

Explore the misty dreams, open massive Dream Chests, and discover exclusive rewards waiting to be claimed. Players can also unlock exclusive packs with up to 80% OFF, making it easier than ever to speed up their progress and strengthen their journey.

Don’t miss the opportunity to obtain the legendary Castle Skin and other exclusive event rewards before the Dream Crisis comes to an end.

Log in now, claim your Dream Chests, and make the most of this limited-time adventure!</span></div></div></div><div page="editorial-home" class="sc-4a7d729f-1 irhQms"><div class="sc-4a7d729f-0 jHqsbK"><div class="sc-4a7d729f-9"><img alt="spoils-awaits - editorial" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-fit:cover;color:transparent" sizes="100vw" srcSet="https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2Fc%2Fc%2Ff%2Fccfb65c22c938c65f35fffc0db660a73.jpg%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2Fc%2Fc%2Ff%2Fccfb65c22c938c65f35fffc0db660a73.jpg%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2Fc%2Fc%2Ff%2Fccfb65c22c938c65f35fffc0db660a73.jpg%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2Fc%2Fc%2Ff%2Fccfb65c22c938c65f35fffc0db660a73.jpg%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2Fc%2Fc%2Ff%2Fccfb65c22c938c65f35fffc0db660a73.jpg%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2Fc%2Fc%2Ff%2Fccfb65c22c938c65f35fffc0db660a73.jpg%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2Fc%2Fc%2Ff%2Fccfb65c22c938c65f35fffc0db660a73.jpg%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.aptoide.com%2Fimgs%2Fc%2Fc%2Ff%2Fccfb65c22c938c65f35fffc0db660a73.jpg%3Fw%3D374%26h%3D198&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="https://static-images.aptoide.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.apt