":"Something is at the door, and every second matters. Knock Knock: Room Defense turns a simple room into a tense survival puzzle for Android players.\n\nKnock Knock: Room Defense is a mobile defense game about surviving attacks by strengthening your room and making smart upgrades. It suits players who enjoy quick strategy, escalating pressure, and clear progression.","icon":"https://cdn.aptoide.com/imgs/b/2/a/b2ab6804ebd84d133d25bec6f3763237.jpg","url":"https://ws75.aptoide.com/api/7/user/action/item/card/get/id=835/store_name=aptoide-web","views":0,"date":"2026-09-03 18:00:23","flair":"appc-bonus-25"},{"card_id":"833","title":"Sea of Doom","slug":"sea-of-doom","message":"Events","summary":"Brave the Sea of Doom in Duck Survival!\nThe Sea of Doom event has arrived in Duck Survival, bringing a limited-time nautical adventure filled with waves of enemies, powerful bosses, and special rewards. The event runs from August 11, 2026, to August 17, 2026.\nTake on the event challenges and work toward rewards including the Vortex Frenzy Shark mount, Poseidon’s Trident, and legendary artifacts such as the Abyssal Tentacle, Dead Tide Vortex, Storm Anchor, and Gold Ram.\nWith only one week to participate, make the most of your daily event activities and progress through the available milestones to collect rewards along the way.\nPrepare your squad, face the dangers of the Sea of Doom, and claim your rewards before the event ends on August 17, 2026.","icon":"https://cdn.aptoide.com/imgs/c/4/d/c4d5f332396109d4f1a7f24e37b215e1.jpg","url":"https://ws75.aptoide.com/api/7/user/action/item/card/get/id=833/store_name=aptoide-web","views":0,"date":"2026-08-14 13:47:04","flair":null},{"card_id":"832","title":"Ludus: New character – Chainsaw!","slug":"ludus-new-character-chainsaw","message":"Events","summary":"Meet Chainsaw, the New Fighter in LUDUS!\nA powerful new character is joining LUDUS・Strategy Battle PvP Game. Meet Chainsaw, a fierce fighter equipped with deadly saw-blade gauntlets designed to bring enemies straight into danger.\nChainsaw can drag opponents toward him before unleashing his devastating blades, making him a dangerous new addition to the battlefield.\nAdd Chainsaw to your lineup, discover his combat abilities, and find new strategies to dominate your opponents in LUDUS!","icon":"https://cdn.aptoide.com/imgs/2/5/e/25eb3362fd6346f2ca54971083eb9772.png","url":"https://ws75.aptoide.com/api/7/user/action/item/card/get/id=832/store_name=aptoide-web","views":0,"date":"2026-08-14 13:44:56","flair":null},{"card_id":"831","title":"Harvest Festival","slug":"harvest-festival","message":"Events","summary":"Celebrate the Harvest Festival in Infinity Kingdom!\nThe Harvest Festival has arrived in Infinity Kingdom, bringing seasonal activities, exclusive collectibles, and special autumn rewards. From August 10, 2026, to August 19, 2026, players on servers that have been running for more than 14 days can join the celebration.\nTake part in activities including Lucky Koi, Harvest Festival Pass, Harvest Catch, Harvest Pastime, Glory Challenge, Pinnacle Trial, Dazzling Wish, and the Exchange Shop to collect limited items and valuable in-game rewards.\nThe festival also introduces new Immortal skins, giving players more ways to customize their lineup and explore different combat possibilities while strengthening their team.\nJoin the Harvest Festival, complete the seasonal activities, and collect your limited-time rewards before the event ends on August 19, 2026.","icon":"https://cdn.aptoide.com/imgs/5/2/e/52e3976d956356d71c26b79a04845008.png","url":"https://ws75.aptoide.com/api/7/user/action/item/card/get/id=831/store_name=aptoide-web","views":0,"date":"2026-08-14 13:43:18","flair":null},{"card_id":"830","title":"New Character Eris — Goddess of Discord","slug":"new-character-eris-goddess-of-discord","message":"Events","summary":"Unleash Chaos with Eris, the Goddess of Discord!\nA powerful new character has arrived! Eris — Goddess of Discord enters the battlefield alongside her deadly puppet, bringing colossal single-target damage and a taste for chaos.\nEris thrives wherever conflict takes root, breaking even the strongest bonds through cunning and manipulation. In battle, she and her puppet can unleash devastating attacks against individual enemies, making Eris a powerful addition to your team.\nTo celebrate her arrival, players can also grab event bundles with discounts of up to 40%, offering valuable resources at special prices.\nSummon Eris, the Goddess of Discord, strengthen your lineup, and take advantage of the limited-time event offers while they’re available!\n\nSTART DATE: 2026-08-11\nEND DATE: 2026-08-25","icon":"https://cdn.aptoide.com/imgs/5/7/4/57453b3d4663bdd8bf5996d3876515a6.jpg","url":"https://ws75.aptoide.com/api/7/user/action/item/card/get/id=830/store_name=aptoide-web","views":0,"date":"2026-08-14 13:41:36","flair":null},{"card_id":"826","title":"Atlantis – Ludus Event","slug":"atlantis-ludus-event","message":"Special Event","summary":"Discover Rare Rewards in the Atlantis Event!\nThe Atlantis event has arrived in LUDUS・Strategy Battle PvP Game, inviting players to explore a mysterious underwater world filled with exclusive rewards. Running from August 6, 2026, to August 10, 2026, this limited-time event offers a new challenge for strategy and card battle fans.\nVenture into Atlantis to open shells, collect masks, and dive deeper in search of rare loot and the coveted Universal Star Perk. Strengthen your heroes, enhance your deck, and prepare for even greater challenges as you progress through the event.\nWhether you enjoy tactical PvP battles, arena competitions, or building the ultimate squad, Atlantis is the perfect opportunity to earn valuable rewards and boost your team’s power.\nEnter Atlantis, complete the event challenges, and claim your exclusive rewards before the event ends on August 10, 2026.","icon":"https://cdn.aptoide.com/imgs/5/e/8/5e8170663b749b0e65aa2140d635e0d8.jpg","url":"https://ws75.aptoide.com/api/7/user/action/item/card/get/id=826/store_name=aptoide-web","views":0,"date":"2026-08-07 15:41:25","flair":null},{"card_id":"825","title":"Vikings’ Birthday","slug":"vikings-birthday","message":"Special Event","summary":"Join the Vikings’ Birthday Celebration!\nThe Vikings’ Birthday event has arrived in Vikings: War of Clans, bringing a month-long celebration filled with bonuses, surprises, and special activities. From August 1, 2026, to September 1, 2026, players can take part in the festivities and enjoy exclusive event rewards.\nThe celebration features a variety of bonuses and surprises throughout the event period, giving both new and veteran Jarls plenty of reasons to join the feast. Be sure to keep an eye on the event schedule so you don’t miss any special activities or rewards.\nWhether you’re strengthening your kingdom or returning to the battlefield, now is the perfect time to celebrate another year of Viking adventures.\nLog in, join the birthday festivities, and claim your rewards before the celebration ends on September 1, 2026.","icon":"https://cdn.aptoide.com/imgs/4/f/f/4ff09d69076c7226fc46a6e1f70fae01.jpg","url":"https://ws75.aptoide.com/api/7/user/action/item/card/get/id=825/store_name=aptoide-web","views":0,"date":"2026-08-07 15:39:50","flair":null},{"card_id":"824","title":"Enter the Unknown - LOM","slug":"enter-the-unknown-lom","message":"Special Event","summary":"Enter the Unknown in the Aug. 1st Event!\nA brand-new adventure awaits in the Aug. 1st Event! From August 7, 2026, to August 13, 2026, players are invited to Enter the Unknown and take on exciting new challenges for a chance to earn valuable rewards.\nExplore mysterious encounters, complete event objectives, and discover surprises hidden throughout this limited-time event. Every challenge you overcome brings you closer to exclusive rewards and new opportunities to strengthen your journey.\nDon’t miss your chance to venture into the unknown. Log in, join the event, and claim your rewards before the Aug. 1st Event comes to an end.","icon":"https://cdn.aptoide.com/imgs/8/0/9/809ec2ee470ddcd98b7cd55e9fa122b2.png","url":"https://ws75.aptoide.com/api/7/user/action/item/card/get/id=824/store_name=aptoide-web","views":0,"date":"2026-08-07 15:38:23","flair":null},{"card_id":"821","title":"Claim Your Legendary Dream Chest!","slug":"claim-your-legendary-dream-chest","message":"Events","summary":"The Claim Your Legendary Dream Chest! event is now live, inviting players to dive back into the mysterious Dream Crisis and uncover hidden treasures. From July 23, 2026, to July 31, 2026, you’ll have the chance to earn valuable rewards through this limited-time event.\n\nExplore the misty dreams, open massive Dream Chests, and discover exclusive rewards waiting to be claimed. Players can also unlock exclusive packs with up to 80% OFF, making it easier than ever to speed up their progress and strengthen their journey.\n\nDon’t miss the opportunity to obtain the legendary Castle Skin and other exclusive event rewards before the Dream Crisis comes to an end.\n\nLog in now, claim your Dream Chests, and make the most of this limited-time adventure!","icon":"https://cdn.aptoide.com/imgs/4/0/0/40007141682e78e4a13c6267f6a3f218.jpg","url":"https://ws75.aptoide.com/api/7/user/action/item/card/get/id=821/store_name=aptoide-web","views":0,"date":"2026-07-24 11:28:42","flair":"appc-bonus-25"},{"card_id":"820","title":"Spoils Awaits","slug":"spoils-awaits","message":"Events","summary":"The Spoils Awaits event has begun, challenging players to track down hidden vaults filled with stolen weapons, rare supplies, and valuable loot. From July 24, 2026, to July 31, 2026, you’ll face some of the deadliest enemies in the wasteland in a race to claim your share of the spoils.\n\nBattle powerful targets, deal as much damage as possible under the updated scoring rules, and climb the event rankings to earn exclusive rewards. Every fight brings you closer to unlocking the treasures hidden within the vaults.\n\nOnly the strongest survivors will rise to the top and secure the greatest rewards before the hunt comes to an end. Gather your forces, take on the challenge, and prove your strength in this limited-time event.","icon":"https://cdn.aptoide.com/imgs/c/c/f/ccfb65c22c938c65f35fffc0db660a73.jpg","url":"https://ws75.aptoide.com/api/7/user/action/item/card/get/id=820/store_name=aptoide-web","views":0,"date":"2026-07-24 11:26:31","flair":"appc-bonus-25"}],"next":13,"offset":0,"count":10,"total":396},"editorsChoice":{"title":"Editors Choice","list":[{"id":76676153,"icon":"https://cdn.aptoide.com/imgs/f/e/d/fed95147de1e6b6b81f775279e1f08da_icon.png","name":"Kickoff Football 26: Be A Pro","score":5,"size":"977.5 MB","store":"catappult","uname":"kickoff-football-2026","trusted":false,"downloads":100000,"parsedName":"Kickoff Football 26: Be A Pro","graphic":"https://cdn.aptoide.com/imgs/c/a/f/caf1e4685bfc63e7a00661a6a094ae43_fgraphic.jpg","package":"com.zqdwjus.google","appcoins":true,"filePath":"","malwareRank":"","isOfficialApp":true},{"id":76103599,"icon":"https://cdn.aptoide.com/imgs/e/8/5/e85e667b4f8de4ed9d89522c1994337c_icon.jpg","name":"Duck Survival","score":3.4,"size":"225 MB","store":"catappult","uname":"duck-survival","trusted":false,"downloads":1000000,"parsedName":"Duck Survival","graphic":"https://cdn.aptoide.com/imgs/5/6/7/56793bdd361694675eace54d2b991a59_fgraphic.jpg","package":"com.mrtgd2us.google","appcoins":true,"filePath":"","malwareRank":"","isOfficialApp":true},{"id":76085678,"icon":"https://cdn.aptoide.com/imgs/5/b/6/5b63c4af0a30ea2ffc1114ba10580b50_icon.png","name":"My Garden Tale","score":5,"size":"1 GB","store":"catappult","uname":"garden-tale-modo-global","trusted":false,"downloads":1000000,"parsedName":"My Garden Tale","graphic":"https://cdn.aptoide.com/imgs/8/1/4/81434276a0b5930a71571b6e2d33484b_fgraphic.jpg","package":"com.jxhy.official","appcoins":true,"filePath":"","malwareRank":"","isOfficialApp":tr